{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02602","headline":"奉和至寿春应令 · 虞世南","name":"奉和至寿春应令","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瑶山盛风乐，南巡务逸游。\n如何事巡抚，民瘼谅斯求。\n文鹤扬轻盖，苍龙饰桂舟。\n泛沫萦沙屿，寒澌拥急流。\n路指八仙馆，途经百尺楼。\n眷言昔游践，廻驾且淹留。\n後车喧凤吹，前旌暎彩旒。\n龙骖驻六马，飞阁上三休。\n调谐金石奏，欢洽羽觞浮。\n天文徒可仰，何以厕琳球。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞世南","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}